{"seq":20,"slug":"realtime-collaborative-frontend","title":"实时协作前端","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend","rating":{"composite":3.59,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实时协作前端\">实时协作前端</h1><p>实时协作前端（Real-time Collaborative Frontend）是 Google Docs 在 2006 年开创、Figma 在 2016 年大规模展示、Notion / Linear / Liveblocks 让现代 Web 应用默认期望的能力——多用户同时编辑同一份文档 / 画布 / 数据，实时看到他人的光标、选区、编辑。技术栈包括传输层（WebSocket、SSE、WebRTC）加上数据层（CRDT、OT）加上体验层（在场感知、光标、冲突解决）。CRDT（Yjs、Automerge）让并发编辑能自动合并，无需服务端协调。Liveblocks、PartyKit、Replicache 是现代的协作平台代表。本 Hub 给前端工程师一条工程化路径——基础（WebSocket / SSE / WebRTC、扩展）、协作数据（CRDT、Yjs、OT、在场感知）、协作体验（光标、选区、冲突、权限）、生产部署（服务端架构、平台选型、测试）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[实时协作前端] --&gt; B[1. 实时基础]&#10;    A --&gt; C[2. 协作数据]&#10;    A --&gt; D[3. 协作 UX]&#10;    A --&gt; E[4. 生产就绪]&#10;    B --&gt; F[WebSocket / SSE / WebRTC / 扩展]&#10;    C --&gt; G[CRDT / Yjs / OT / 在场感知]&#10;    D --&gt; H[光标 / 选区 / 冲突 / 角色]&#10;    E --&gt; I[服务端架构 / 平台 / 测试]\">graph TD\n    A[实时协作前端] --&gt; B[1. 实时基础]\n    A --&gt; C[2. 协作数据]\n    A --&gt; D[3. 协作 UX]\n    A --&gt; E[4. 生产就绪]\n    B --&gt; F[WebSocket / SSE / WebRTC / 扩展]\n    C --&gt; G[CRDT / Yjs / OT / 在场感知]\n    D --&gt; H[光标 / 选区 / 冲突 / 角色]\n    E --&gt; I[服务端架构 / 平台 / 测试]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n<th>实战代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时基础</td>\n<td>WebSocket、SSE、WebRTC、扩展</td>\n<td>Slack、Google Meet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协作数据</td>\n<td>CRDT、Yjs、Automerge、OT</td>\n<td>Figma、Linear</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协作 UX</td>\n<td>光标、选区、冲突、权限</td>\n<td>Notion、Liveblocks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产就绪</td>\n<td>服务端架构、平台、测试</td>\n<td>PartyKit、Replicache</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>学完本 Hub 你将能选对传输方式（WS 与 SSE 与 WebRTC 之间）、用 Yjs 构建协作文档、设计多人光标加选区的体验、把协作服务端扩到百万级用户。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"realtime-foundations","title":"实时基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"websocket-and-sse","title":"WebSocket 与 SSE","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/websocket-and-sse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"webrtc-peer-to-peer","title":"WebRTC 与点对点通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/webrtc-peer-to-peer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"transport-selection","title":"传输协议选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/transport-selection"},{"seq":4,"slug":"scaling-realtime","title":"实时系统扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/scaling-realtime"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"collaborative-data","title":"协作数据","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crdt-fundamentals","title":"CRDT 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/crdt-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"yjs-and-automerge","title":"Yjs 与 Automerge","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/yjs-and-automerge"},{"seq":3,"slug":"operational-transform","title":"操作变换（OT）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/operational-transform"},{"seq":4,"slug":"awareness-and-presence","title":"Awareness 与在线感知（Presence）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/awareness-and-presence"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"collaborative-ux","title":"协作 UX","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multiplayer-cursors","title":"多人光标","url":"/l-doc